How to Use It :

What you need :  Python version 3.10 or newer. 
 
Tapestries is Built for MacOS. 

To install just copy and paste this:

git clone https://github.com/Dhruvahere/Tapestries
cd CAC2026
python3 -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -e .

To run:

source .venv/bin/activate
tapestries

If command not found:

python launch .py.

All your data is found in the "tapestries.db" 

